The tree includes the following third-party material under its own license:

crates/runtime/src/container/seccomp.json
    The default seccomp profile, from the containers-common project
    (https://github.com/containers/common, pkg/seccomp/seccomp.json), which
    derives it from the default profile of Moby/Docker.
    License: Apache-2.0.

crates/registry/src/shortnames.conf
    The table of short name aliases of the containers project
    (https://github.com/containers/shortnames, 000-shortnames.conf, shipped
    by containers-common).  License: Apache-2.0.

crates/runtime/src/container/apparmor-profile.txt
    The default AppArmor profile of containers (`velarx-default`), taken
    from the default profile of the containers-common project
